{'symbol': 'HPE', 'date': '2023-05-19 13:00:00', 'title': 'HPE AND TOKYO TECH COLLABORATE TO BUILD THE NEXT GENERATION TSUBAME4.0 SUPERCOMPUTER FOR ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE, SCIENTIFIC RESEARCH, AND INNOVATION', 'text': "TOKYO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HEWLETT PACKARD ENTERPRISE (NYSE: HPE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT WAS SELECTED BY TOKYO INSTITUTE OF TECHNOLOGY (TOKYO TECH) GLOBAL SCIENTIFIC INFORMATION AND COMPUTING CENTER (GSIC) TO BUILD ITS NEXT-GENERATION SUPERCOMPUTER, TSUBAME4.0, TO ACCELERATE AI-DRIVEN SCIENTIFIC DISCOVERY IN MEDICINE, MATERIALS SCIENCE, CLIMATE RESEARCH, AND TURBULENCE IN URBAN ENVIRONMENTS. TOKYO TECH IS ONE OF THE WORLD'S LEADING UNIVERSITIES IN SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY. WITH THE TSUBAME4.0 SUPER."}